<title>POLAND: Polifarb-W Q3 net rises to PLN 7.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Polifarb-W Q3 net rises to PLN 7.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
